    <briefdescription>
<para>stores a path from an innermost scope to the global scope (not part of the path) in form of a sequence of Sage nodes that represent scopes (SgScopeStatements or SgDeclarationStatements). </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The path is traversed using the range [rbegin(), rend()) to get the scopes in order from outermost scope to innermost scope.</para></listitem><listitem><para>The path may contain scopes without names. Those will be skipped when the qualified name is stringified. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
